        "description": "A teenage Witch who lives in the East side slums of the capital of Azami, selling potions to the residents, usually for information rather than money on account of the poverty in the East side. She is a former pupil of Alka. \n\n~!She is secretly the missing princess of the kingdom, Maria Azami.!~",
